      "english": "Pros and cons of central heating"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小赵是南方人，刚开始在北京工作。",
      "traditional": "小趙是南方人，剛開始在北京工作。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhào shì nán fāng rén gāng kāi shǐ zài běi jīng gōng zuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "这是他在北京的第一个冬天，来北京以前他很担心天气会太冷。",
      "traditional": "這是他在北京的第一個冬天，來北京以前他很擔心天氣會太冷。",
      "pinyin": "zhè shì tā zài běi jīng de dì yī ge dōng tiān lái běi jīng yǐ qián tā hěn dān xīn tiān qì huì tài lěng",
      "english": "Xiao Zhao is from southern China and just started to work in Beijing."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "天气冷下来的时候，他发现自己一点儿也不用担心这个问题。",
      "traditional": "天氣冷下來的時候，他發現自己一點兒也不用擔心這個問題。",
      "pinyin": "tiān qì lěng xia lai de shí hou tā fā xiàn zì jǐ yì diǎn'r yě bú yòng dān xīn zhè ge wèn tí",
      "english": "This is the first winter for him in Beijing. Before he came to Beijing he was worried about the cold weather."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "因为每个房间里都有暖气，比空调热多了。",
      "traditional": "因為每個房間裡都有暖氣，比空調熱多了。",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi měi ge fáng jiān lǐ dōu yǒu nuǎn qì bǐ kōng tiáo rè duō le",
      "english": "When the weather got colder, he realized that he didn’t need to worry about this problem at all."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "可是他发现了一个新问题：房间里空气太干了，这让他的鼻子、嗓子和皮肤都很不舒服。",
      "traditional": "可是他發現了一個新問題：房間裡空氣太乾了，這讓他的鼻子、嗓子和皮膚都很不舒服。",
      "pinyin": "kě shì tā fā xiàn le yí ge xīn wèn tí fáng jiān lǐ kōng qì tài gān le zhè ràng tā de bí zi sǎng zi hé pí fū dōu hěn bù shū fu",
      "english": "Because there were radiators in every room, and it was much warmer than air conditioning."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "他的同事告诉他，可以在暖气片上放一块湿毛巾，或者在房间里放一盆水，",
      "traditional": "他的同事告訴他，可以在暖氣片上放一塊濕毛巾，或者在房間裡放一盆水，",
      "pinyin": "tā de tóng shì gào su tā kě yǐ zài nuǎn qì piàn shang fàng yí kuài shī máo jīn huò zhě zài fáng jiān lǐ fàng yì pén shuǐ",
      "english": "However, he found a new problem: the air in the room is too dry, which makes his nose, throat and skin uncomfortable."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "这样空气就不会那么干了。",
      "traditional": "這樣空氣就不會那麼乾了。",
      "pinyin": "zhè yàng kōng qì jiù bú huì nà me gān le",
      "english": "His colleague told him to put a wet towel on the radiator, or a basin of water in the room."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小赵觉得这个办法不错，房间里舒服多了。",
      "traditional": "小趙覺得這個辦法不錯，房間裡舒服多了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhào jué de zhè ge bàn fǎ bú cuò fáng jiān lǐ shū fu duō le",
      "english": "This way the air won't be so dry."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiao Zhao thought it was quite a good idea, and the room became much more comfortable."
    }
  ],
