    "sentence_translations": [
      "Pros and cons of central heating",
      "",
      "Xiao Zhao is from southern China and just started to work in Beijing.",
      "This is the first winter for him in Beijing. Before he came to Beijing he was worried about the cold weather.",
      "When the weather got colder, he realized that he didn’t need to worry about this problem at all.",
      "Because there were radiators in every room, and it was much warmer than air conditioning.",
      "However, he found a new problem: the air in the room is too dry, which makes his nose, throat and skin uncomfortable.",
      "His colleague told him to put a wet towel on the radiator, or a basin of water in the room.",
      "This way the air won't be so dry.",
      "Xiao Zhao thought it was quite a good idea, and the room became much more comfortable.",
      ""
